{"3521270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Phoenix's Faye", "steam_appid": 3521270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/8350e692606ea77bc94a8efe1ea30a3a.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a game that I developed alone using Unreal. The story background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young woman trained in martial arts since childhood, she masters swordsmanship, archery, and formidable hand-to-hand combat! For some unknown reason, she finds herself trapped in a fantastical world. To return home, she must fight endlessly. This fantastical world features diverse regions, each with its own unique style—wuxia, xianxia, dark fantasy, etc. She battles different enemies across these varied lands, embracing the thrill of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/6262a7036a0699fcefdf0091bd0c1978.avif?t=1784557125\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/2b2ba9a5f0057ef4103cd019e498a6f9.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clothing Destruction System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/75d9905af826ae4ab212622a7bba9aae.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New &quot;All Thumbs&quot; Difficulty (Easy Mode)!</strong><br>You can enable Easy Mode in the options, and switch difficulties anytime during gameplay. Don't worry—enemies won't become dumb in Easy Mode, but players can regain large amounts of health by performing stylish moves like parries and perfect dodges. Additionally, the special meter fills up more easily, allowing you to unleash powerful moves anytime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are parries and perfect dodges hard to execute?</strong><br>This might be the easiest action game to pull off parries and perfect dodges! The game's mechanics are quite lenient, so players can stylishly dodge and parry to their heart's content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/91b127563f05a7486b61dc8d538380a7.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>‘Swords &amp; Shadows’ Level Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine faces relentless group battles—swordsmen, shield bearers, archersk, a true swarm combat experience. No polite duels here，enemies rush in all at once, no holds barred!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch combat styles on the fly: Wield a tachi, switch to arrows, or go bare-handed，adapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tachi mastery against crowds: Parry to deflect attackers, perfect dodge to counter — each slash carves a gleaming arc through foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unarmed? No problem! In this world, martial arts unleash &quot;Mountain-Splitting Strikes&quot; and &quot;Heart-Piercing Kicks&quot; — sending enemies flying in waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health packs—style equals survival: Regain HP by nailing parries, dodges, etc. Build the Rage Gauge(Fire), when full, unleash a screen-clearing ultimate attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are more levels waiting for you to challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/70dcf5fae8081c65fb8fcff44968f1bd.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31334f214668f0446b0a8028ebfe76a4.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph