les—swordsmen, shield bearers, archersk, a true swarm combat experience. No polite duels here，enemies rush in all at once, no holds barred!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch combat styles on the fly: Wield a tachi, switch to arrows, or go bare-handed，adapt to any threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tachi mastery against crowds: Parry to deflect attackers, perfect dodge to counter — each slash carves a gleaming arc through foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unarmed? No problem! In this world, martial arts unleash &quot;Mountain-Splitting Strikes&quot; and &quot;Heart-Piercing Kicks&quot; — sending enemies flying in waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget health packs—style equals survival: Regain HP by nailing parries, dodges, etc. Build the Rage Gauge(Fire), when full, unleash a screen-clearing ultimate attack!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are more levels waiting for you to challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.webm?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/31616f8e9a942ba11652ace17880dee2.mp4?t=1784557125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521270/extras/3a42c40fb75b54107577a83435a1fd7e.poster.avif?t=1784557125\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/352